  "Overlapping Louvres.": { EN: "Overlapping Louvres.", FR: "Lames chevauchantes." },
  "Please see the profile of our louvres. The ‘S’ shape makes it so the louvres overlap. There are 2 main benefits to this:": { EN: "Please see the profile of our louvres. The ‘S’ shape makes it so the louvres overlap. There are 2 main benefits to this:", FR: "Veuillez consulter le profil de nos lames. La forme en 'S' permet aux lames de se chevaucher. Cela présente 2 avantages principaux :" },
  "Because they overlap we you can leave the louvres open at a 44 degree angle which would allow the light to come in but not the rain. Any light to normal rainfall would give you the benefit of not getting your furniture wet when you are not home.": { EN: "Because they overlap we you can leave the louvres open at a 44 degree angle which would allow the light to come in but not the rain. Any light to normal rainfall would give you the benefit of not getting your furniture wet when you are not home.", FR: "Parce qu'elles se chevauchent, vous pouvez laisser les lames ouvertes à un angle de 44 degrés, ce qui permet à la lumière d'entrer mais pas à la pluie. Lors d'une pluie légère à normale, vous avez l'avantage de ne pas mouiller vos meubles lorsque vous n'êtes pas chez vous." },
  "Again because they overlap, we do not need to have a rubber connection that will degrade over time.": { EN: "Again because they overlap, we do not need to have a rubber connection that will degrade over time.", FR: "Encore une fois, parce qu'elles se chevauchent, nous n'avons pas besoin d'un joint en caoutchouc qui se dégraderait avec le temps." },
