  "Curtains:": { EN: "Curtains:", FR: "Rideaux :" },
  "Classic Curtains only. We order from MosquitoCurtains.com who have been a reliable partner for years. We can order for you with a small mark-up or you can order direct. For Electric blind systems, please find a local supplier. We will help with the needed data on the pergola but it’s always good practice to have this done after the pergola is installed.": { EN: "Classic Curtains only. We order from MosquitoCurtains.com who have been a reliable partner for years. We can order for you with a small mark-up or you can order direct. For Electric blind systems, please find a local supplier. We will help with the needed data on the pergola but it’s always good practice to have this done after the pergola is installed.", FR: "Rideaux classiques uniquement. Nous commandons chez MosquitoCurtains.com, un partenaire fiable depuis des années. Nous pouvons commander pour vous avec une légère marge ou vous commander directement. Pour les systèmes électriques, veuillez trouver un fournisseur local. Nous vous fournirons les données nécessaires sur la pergola, mais il est toujours préférable de le faire après l'installation." },
  "Flower Hanger:": { EN: "Flower Hanger:", FR: "Support à fleurs :" },
