  "Extruded aluminum louvers optimized for precision fit, durability, and corrosion resistance.": { EN: "Extruded aluminum louvers optimized for precision fit, durability, and corrosion resistance.", FR: "Lames en aluminium extrude optimisees pour la precision, la durabilite et la resistance a la corrosion." },
