  "First snow fall only (2-4\")": { EN: "First snow fall only (2-4\")", FR: "Premiere neige seulement (2-4 po)" },
  "First, the most solid permanent 3-Season pergola. It can support some snow (3-4 inches) but is built to stay open in winter. We use high-grade steel and aluminum, double powder coated for protection. We do not use stainless steel for corners because structural steel is stronger.": { EN: "First, the most solid permanent 3-Season pergola. It can support some snow (3-4 inches) but is built to stay open in winter. We use high-grade steel and aluminum, double powder coated for protection. We do not use stainless steel for corners because structural steel is stronger.", FR: "D'abord, la pergola permanente 3 saisons la plus solide. Elle peut supporter un peu de neige (3-4 pouces) mais doit rester ouverte en hiver. Nous utilisons de l'acier et de l'aluminium de haute qualite, doublement thermolaques. Nous n'utilisons pas d'inox aux coins car l'acier structurel est plus solide." },
  "Flower Hanger": { EN: "Flower Hanger", FR: "Support a fleurs" },
  "For commercial or permit-heavy projects, we can provide engineering support documents, specs, and shop drawings.": { EN: "For commercial or permit-heavy projects, we can provide engineering support documents, specs, and shop drawings.", FR: "Pour les projets commerciaux ou exigeant des permis, nous pouvons fournir documents d'ingenierie, specs et dessins d'atelier." },
  "Friends, family, neighbours and just about everyone who saw the pergola, I had originally bought, loved the idea and the comfort it provided. But unfortunately, they didn’t know how often it broke. I got the run around by the seller for service… getting me very upset.": { EN: "Friends, family, neighbours and just about everyone who saw the pergola, I had originally bought, loved the idea and the comfort it provided. But unfortunately, they didn’t know how often it broke. I got the run around by the seller for service… getting me very upset.", FR: "Mes amis, ma famille, mes voisins et presque tous ceux qui voyaient la pergola que j'avais achetee adoraient l'idee et le confort. Mais malheureusement, ils ne savaient pas a quel point elle tombait souvent en panne. Le vendeur me faisait tourner en rond pour le service, ce qui m'a beaucoup frustre." },
  "From our versatile 3 and 4 season pergolas designed to enhance any outdoor space to our industry-leading feature of the longest span between posts, reaching an impressive 20 feet (longer on rare occasions), we’re committed to delivering excellence at every step. Join us in creating outdoor havens that inspire and endure.": { EN: "From our versatile 3 and 4 season pergolas designed to enhance any outdoor space to our industry-leading feature of the longest span between posts, reaching an impressive 20 feet (longer on rare occasions), we’re committed to delivering excellence at every step. Join us in creating outdoor havens that inspire and endure.", FR: "De nos pergolas 3 et 4 saisons polyvalentes jusqu'a notre portee leader de l'industrie entre poteaux, atteignant 20 pieds (et plus dans de rares cas), nous nous engageons a l'excellence a chaque etape. Joignez-vous a nous pour creer des espaces exterieurs inspirants et durables." },
  "Full 6061 and 6063 T6 Aluminum Extrusions, Load Tested for Canadian Climate. Completely Waterproof and Customizable.": { EN: "Full 6061 and 6063 T6 Aluminum Extrusions, Load Tested for Canadian Climate. Completely Waterproof and Customizable.", FR: "Extrusions complètes en aluminium 6061 et 6063 T6, testées pour le climat canadien. Complètement étanche et personnalisable." },
  "Gerry Crepin Cartage": { EN: "Gerry Crepin Cartage", FR: "Gerry Crepin Cartage" },
