  "Heavy Gage Aluminum": { EN: "Heavy Gage Aluminum", FR: "Aluminium forte epaisseur" },
  "Heavy steel flat bar with eye-nut for hammocks and swings. Up to 200lbs per eye-nut for egg-shaped swing use.": { EN: "Heavy steel flat bar with eye-nut for hammocks and swings. Up to 200lbs per eye-nut for egg-shaped swing use.", FR: "Barre plate en acier robuste avec oeillet pour hamacs et balancoires. Jusqu'a 200 lb par oeillet pour balancoire type oeuf." },
  "Hickory Decks": { EN: "Hickory Decks", FR: "Hickory Decks" },
  "I look forward to making your family or business happy. I hope you, like many others, will share the images of a baby-shower, baptism, bridal-shower, graduation or any other important event that will go on, rain or too much shine. Restaurants book their terraces regardless of the forecast, and families plan their weekend BBQs without worry…Not to mention, you, simply enjoying your outdoor space daily without having the searing sun or rain ruining your day.": { EN: "I look forward to making your family or business happy. I hope you, like many others, will share the images of a baby-shower, baptism, bridal-shower, graduation or any other important event that will go on, rain or too much shine. Restaurants book their terraces regardless of the forecast, and families plan their weekend BBQs without worry…Not to mention, you, simply enjoying your outdoor space daily without having the searing sun or rain ruining your day.", FR: "J'ai hate de rendre votre famille ou votre entreprise heureuse. J'espere que vous partagerez, comme beaucoup d'autres, les images de vos evenements importants: baby shower, bapteme, mariage, graduation et plus, pluie ou grand soleil. Les restaurants reservent leurs terrasses sans craindre la meteo, et les familles planifient leurs BBQ sans stress... sans oublier votre plaisir quotidien de l'exterieur." },
  "I worked with engineers and designers for over 2 years, spending a small fortune to design something that almost every professional told me was an insane endeavour, \"there is a reason nobody has done this Mike!\", \"snow is heavy, very heavy\" was something I heard repeatedly over that time. But I kept remembering the disappointed faces of those at my house and just kept going.": { EN: "I worked with engineers and designers for over 2 years, spending a small fortune to design something that almost every professional told me was an insane endeavour, \"there is a reason nobody has done this Mike!\", \"snow is heavy, very heavy\" was something I heard repeatedly over that time. But I kept remembering the disappointed faces of those at my house and just kept going.", FR: "J'ai travaille avec des ingenieurs et des designers pendant plus de 2 ans, en depensant une petite fortune pour concevoir quelque chose que presque tous jugeaient fou: \"il y a une raison pour laquelle personne ne l'a fait, Mike\". \"La neige est lourde, tres lourde\" revenait souvent. Mais je revoyais les visages decus chez moi, et j'ai continue." },
