  "Made of aluminum with support underneath. Two sizes. Used for light objects such as glasses, cups, and pitchers.": { EN: "Made of aluminum with support underneath. Two sizes. Used for light objects such as glasses, cups, and pitchers.", FR: "Fabrique en aluminium avec support inferieur. Deux formats. Utilise pour des objets legers comme verres, tasses et pichets." },
