  "Monitor activity, review leads, and manage website operations.": { EN: "Monitor activity, review leads, and manage website operations.", FR: "Suivez l'activite, examinez les prospects et gerez les operations du site." },
  "Most competitors use bent sheet metal with #12 screws. We use 10g steel and six Grade-8 half-inch bolts per corner, plus a 4in x 4in HSS support and additional reinforcement options for extreme wind conditions.": { EN: "Most competitors use bent sheet metal with #12 screws. We use 10g steel and six Grade-8 half-inch bolts per corner, plus a 4in x 4in HSS support and additional reinforcement options for extreme wind conditions.", FR: "La plupart des concurrents utilisent de la tole pliee avec des vis #12. Nous utilisons de l'acier 10g et six boulons Grade-8 d'un demi-pouce par coin, plus un support HSS 4x4 et des options de renfort pour vents extremes." },
  "Mr Pergola - Official | 100% Aluminium | Adjustable Louvre": { EN: "Mr Pergola - Official | 100% Aluminium | Adjustable Louvre", FR: "Mr Pergola - Officiel | 100 % Aluminium | Lames ajustables" },
