  "Mr.Pergola Corner Test": { EN: "Mr.Pergola Corner Test", FR: "Test d'angle Mr.Pergola" },
  "Now for the 4-Season pergola. It is built for real winter use and rated for up to 3 feet of wet snow. Our measured snow-load capacity is 88 lbs/sqft, validated by specialized engineering firms.": { EN: "Now for the 4-Season pergola. It is built for real winter use and rated for up to 3 feet of wet snow. Our measured snow-load capacity is 88 lbs/sqft, validated by specialized engineering firms.", FR: "Passons a la pergola 4 saisons. Elle est concue pour un vrai usage hivernal et cotee jusqu'a 3 pieds de neige mouillee. Notre capacite mesuree est de 88 lb/pi2, validee par des firmes d'ingenierie specialisees." },
  "Now homeowners, restaurants, hotels alike, knock on our door, call or order online their customized project that makes them so happy, making me even happier. It WILL change your outdoor living, no question about it.": { EN: "Now homeowners, restaurants, hotels alike, knock on our door, call or order online their customized project that makes them so happy, making me even happier. It WILL change your outdoor living, no question about it.", FR: "Aujourd'hui, proprietaires, restaurants et hotels viennent nous voir, appellent ou commandent en ligne leur projet personnalise. Cela change vraiment la vie exterieure, sans aucun doute." },
  "Now the fun part for all you technically adept buyers...": { EN: "Now the fun part for all you technically adept buyers...", FR: "Maintenant la partie amusante pour les acheteurs techniques..." },
  "One of our biggest points of pride is that when engineers come to see our product, they buy our product. We ask our clients to visit and compare the quality difference against any other pergola on the market.": { EN: "One of our biggest points of pride is that when engineers come to see our product, they buy our product. We ask our clients to visit and compare the quality difference against any other pergola on the market.", FR: "L'une de nos grandes fiertes: quand des ingenieurs viennent voir notre produit, ils l'achetent. Nous invitons nos clients a visiter et comparer la difference de qualite avec toute autre pergola du marche." },
  "Our 4-Season Pergolas are specifically engineered for the heavy snow loads of Canadian winters. The reinforced 1/4\" bracket system and internal structural supports allow the louvres to remain safely closed during active snowfall, providing true year-round protection.": { EN: "Our 4-Season Pergolas are specifically engineered for the heavy snow loads of Canadian winters. The reinforced 1/4\" bracket system and internal structural supports allow the louvres to remain safely closed during active snowfall, providing true year-round protection.", FR: "Nos pergolas 4 saisons sont specialement concues pour les fortes charges de neige canadiennes. Le systeme de supports renforces de 1/4 po et les renforts internes permettent aux lames de rester fermees en securite pendant les chutes de neige." },
  "Our classic pergola can be customized like no other: height extensions, L-shapes, extended louvres, and extended sub-frames for added coverage. Wall-mounted configurations are available where structure allows.": { EN: "Our classic pergola can be customized like no other: height extensions, L-shapes, extended louvres, and extended sub-frames for added coverage. Wall-mounted configurations are available where structure allows.", FR: "Notre pergola classique est personnalisable comme aucune autre : extensions de hauteur, formes en L, lames allongees et sous-cadres etendus pour plus de couverture. Les configurations murales sont possibles selon la structure." },
  "Our pergolas are built to withstand the harsh Canadian winters while providing an elegant, comfortable outdoor sanctuary during the summer months. The rotating louvers offer complete control over sun and shade, and our heavy-duty extrusions ensure your investment lasts for decades.": { EN: "Our pergolas are built to withstand the harsh Canadian winters while providing an elegant, comfortable outdoor sanctuary during the summer months. The rotating louvers offer complete control over sun and shade, and our heavy-duty extrusions ensure your investment lasts for decades.", FR: "Nos pergolas sont concues pour resister aux hivers canadiens rigoureux tout en offrant un espace exterieur elegant et confortable l'ete. Les lames rotatives donnent un controle total du soleil et de l'ombre, et nos extrusions robustes assurent un investissement durable." },
  "Our S-shaped louvre profile creates overlap. This allows light while reducing rain entry at partial opening angles and avoids relying on rubber interfaces that degrade over time.": { EN: "Our S-shaped louvre profile creates overlap. This allows light while reducing rain entry at partial opening angles and avoids relying on rubber interfaces that degrade over time.", FR: "Notre profil de lame en S cree un chevauchement. Cela laisse passer la lumiere en reduisant l'entree de pluie a ouverture partielle et evite les joints en caoutchouc qui se degradent avec le temps." },
  "Our wind tests are done by professional structural engineering firms using finite element analysis, not improvised fan demonstrations.": { EN: "Our wind tests are done by professional structural engineering firms using finite element analysis, not improvised fan demonstrations.", FR: "Nos essais au vent sont realises par des firmes d'ingenierie structurelle avec analyse par elements finis, pas avec des demonstrations improvisees." },
