  "Sign in to manage internal admin operations.": { EN: "Sign in to manage internal admin operations.", FR: "Connectez-vous pour gerer les operations internes d'administration." },
  "Simple integrated design with an eye-nut protruding below. Do not use for egg-shaped hanging swing seats.": { EN: "Simple integrated design with an eye-nut protruding below. Do not use for egg-shaped hanging swing seats.", FR: "Conception integree simple avec oeillet depassant en dessous. Ne pas utiliser pour des sieges suspendus en forme d'oeuf." },
  "Snow Load Capacity": { EN: "Snow Load Capacity", FR: "Capacite de charge de neige" },
  "Snow-load calculations are completed with advanced engineering software and code-compliant methodology. We engineered for 24in wet snow / 36in powder snow plus safety buffer.": { EN: "Snow-load calculations are completed with advanced engineering software and code-compliant methodology. We engineered for 24in wet snow / 36in powder snow plus safety buffer.", FR: "Les calculs de charge de neige sont realises avec des logiciels avances et une methodologie conforme aux normes. Nous avons concu pour 24 po de neige mouillee / 36 po de neige poudreuse plus marge de securite." },
  "Sold by 20ft lengths with personalized brackets up to 90in. Each slat is 4in tall and made of high-grade aluminum.": { EN: "Sold by 20ft lengths with personalized brackets up to 90in. Each slat is 4in tall and made of high-grade aluminum.", FR: "Vendu en longueurs de 20 pi avec supports personnalises jusqu'a 90 po. Chaque latte fait 4 po de haut et est en aluminium haute qualite." },
  "somfy": { EN: "somfy", FR: "somfy" },
  "Span (distance between posts), both deep and wide": { EN: "Span (distance between posts), both deep and wide", FR: "Portee (distance entre poteaux), profondeur et largeur" },
